            <p data-scroll="" data-scroll-speed="-1" data-scroll-position="top" data-scroll-offset="0%, -50%">What stays with me in Bloom Into You is the time it gives its characters to be uncertain. Affection does not arrive in the same shape for everyone. A person can want to be close and still be afraid of what closeness asks of them.</p>
